Interactive Job Search & Filtering

You can quickly narrow down job listings using the search bar and category filters. The interface is designed to feel familiar and efficient.

· Search Bar: The prominent search field lets you type keywords like "cashier" or "stocker" to find relevant positions. The filter button beside it suggests further refinement options.
· Category Pills: A horizontal scroll of department tags (All jobs, Cashier, Stocker, etc.) lets you instantly filter the list by job type. The active filter is highlighted in orange.
· Job Cards: Each listing shows the role, location, shift type, and salary. Hovering over a card reveals a subtle highlight and an arrow, indicating it's clickable for more details.
· Job Count & Footer: The header shows the number of open positions, and the footer reinforces that the listings are verified, building trust.

---

Optimization Tip: You can replace the sample job listings and their details in the .jobs-list section with your own data. The category pills in .category-scroll can also be customized to match your specific job departments.